      "id": "r",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 563.2,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "\"a\" + \"\\xFF\".b      -> ASCII-8BIT: \"a\" is all ASCII, so it fits\n\"é\" + \"\\xFF\".b      -> Encoding::CompatibilityError\n\"a#{\"\\xE9\".b}\"       -> ASCII-8BIT, by the same rule\nforce_encoding     relabels the same bytes; encode converts them",
      "originalText": "\"a\" + \"\\xFF\".b      -> ASCII-8BIT: \"a\" is all ASCII, so it fits\n\"é\" + \"\\xFF\".b      -> Encoding::CompatibilityError\n\"a#{\"\\xE9\".b}\"       -> ASCII-8BIT, by the same rule\nforce_encoding     relabels the same bytes; encode converts them",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
